window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-19b55055ec1e5e1e"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"web-development\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"web\">Web 开发</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>根据设计稿和提示词构建响应式界面。</p> <p>Codex 很适合配合现有设计系统工作，并能综合考虑项目约束和视觉输入，生成响应式界面。构建 Web 应用并需要反复调整前端设计时，可以参考以下用例。</p> <p><a id=\"get-from-idea-to-prototype\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">从想法做出原型</h2> <p>使用 Codex 把初步想法转化为视觉方向，并实现第一个原型。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/idea-to-proof-of-concept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">从想法到概念验证（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 和 ImageGen 把初步想法转化为视觉方向，并实现最小可行的……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"build-from-figma\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"figma\">根据 Figma 设计进行开发</h2> <p>让 Codex 从 Figma 获取设计背景，并编写符合代码库组件、样式和设计系统的代码。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/figma-designs-to-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">将 Figma 设计转化为代码（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 Codex 获取 Figma 中的设计背景、素材和变体，再编写符合代码库要求的代码……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"iterate-on-the-ui\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">迭代改进界面</h2> <p>利用视觉输入或提示词让 Codex 进行有针对性的修改，并让它在浏览器中验证结果。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/frontend-designs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">构建响应式前端界面（本地尚未收录）</a>：让 Codex 根据屏幕截图和设计简报制作界面，使其符合代码库中的……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"pick-up-scoped-slack-tasks\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"slack\">承接范围明确的 Slack 任务</h2> <p>在 Slack 中提及 Codex，让它在后台处理功能请求或问题报告。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/slack-coding-tasks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">从 Slack 启动编码任务（本地尚未收录）</a>：在符合条件的工作区共享环境中，于 Slack 中提及 <code>@ChatGPT</code>，请求它处理代码库工作……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"deploy-a-preview\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">部署预览版本</h2> <p>使用 Codex 和 Vercel 构建或更新 Web 应用，然后部署一个可分享的在线预览地址。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/deploy-app-or-website\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">部署应用或网站（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 Codex 和 Vercel，把代码库、屏幕截图、设计稿或初步想法转化为……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"ship-changes-faster\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">加快交付</h2> <p>在 GitHub 中使用 Codex 检查代码变更是否安全，帮助你在合并前发现问题。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/github-code-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">审查 GitHub 拉取请求（本地尚未收录）</a>：使用 GitHub 中的 Codex 代码审查，自动发现回归问题、缺失的测试以及……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"web-development\">Web development</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Build responsive UI from designs and prompts.</p> <p>Codex works great with existing design systems, taking into account constraints and visual inputs to produce a responsive UI. These use cases are helpful when you are building web apps and need to iterate on frontend designs.</p> <h2 id=\"get-from-idea-to-prototype\">Get from idea to prototype</h2> <p>Use Codex to turn a rough idea into a visual direction and implement a first prototype.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/idea-to-proof-of-concept\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get from idea to proof of concept (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex with ImageGen to turn a rough idea into a visual direction, implement the smallest...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"build-from-figma\">Build from Figma</h2> <p>Use Codex to pull design context from Figma and turn it into code that follows the repo's components, styling, and design system.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/figma-designs-to-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Turn Figma designs into code (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex to pull design context, assets, and variants from Figma, translate them into code...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"iterate-on-the-ui\">Iterate on the UI</h2> <p>Leverage Codex to make targeted changes from visual inputs or prompts, and have it verify its work in the browser.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/frontend-designs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Build responsive front-end designs (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex to translate screenshots and design briefs into code that matches the repo's...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"pick-up-scoped-slack-tasks\">Pick up scoped Slack tasks</h2> <p>Tag Codex in Slack when there's a feature request or a reported issue, so that it can pick up the task and work on it in the background.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/slack-coding-tasks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kick off coding tasks from Slack (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Mention <code>@ChatGPT</code> in Slack to request repository work in an eligible workspace-shared Codex...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"deploy-a-preview\">Deploy a preview</h2> <p>Use Codex to build or update a web app, deploy it with Vercel, and hand back a live URL you can share.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/deploy-app-or-website\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Deploy an app or website (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex with Build Web Apps and Vercel to turn a repo, screenshot, design, or rough app...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"ship-changes-faster\">Ship changes faster</h2> <p>Use Codex in GitHub to make sure changes are safe to merge so you can have a faster development loop.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/github-code-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Review GitHub pull requests (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Use Codex code review in GitHub to automatically surface regressions, missing tests, and...</li> </ul>"};
